# Where the phone build looks for the prediction service.
#
# Leave empty for the web build: the app and the service share an origin there,
# and the dev server proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000.
#
# The native build MUST set this, and it must be https — the app is served from
# https://localhost inside the WebView, so a relative path resolves to the
# handset, and Android blocks cleartext http by default. Getting either wrong
# gives you an app where every screen is simply empty.
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://api.yourdomain.tz npm run mobile:sync
#
# It can also be changed at runtime from the app's Settings screen, which is
# how you point a test build at a laptop on the LAN without rebuilding.
VITE_API_BASE=
